The following issues require manual code changes:
  ./service.go:17:14: req.Spec() moves to the connect.CallInfoForServerContext(ctx) info's Spec field in v2
  ./service.go:17:36: req.Peer().Addr moves to the connect.CallInfoForServerContext(ctx) info's PeerAddr field in v2
  ./service.go:22:10: req.Peer() is split in v2: PeerAddr and Protocol move to the connect.CallInfoForServerContext(ctx) info, and the query to the connecthttp.ServerInfoForContext(ctx) info's RequestURL()
  ./service.go:23:25: req.Peer() is split in v2: PeerAddr and Protocol move to the connect.CallInfoForServerContext(ctx) info, and the query to the connecthttp.ServerInfoForContext(ctx) info's RequestURL()
  ./service.go:23:54: req.HTTPMethod() moves to the connecthttp.ServerInfoForContext(ctx) info's HTTPMethod() in v2
  ./service.go:25:15: req.Spec() moves to the connect.CallInfoForServerContext(ctx) info's Spec field in v2
  ./service.go:35:14: req.Peer() moves to the connect.NewClientContext(ctx) info's PeerAddr and Protocol fields in v2
  ./service.go:35:31: req.HTTPMethod() moves to the connecthttp.ClientInfoForContext(ctx) info's HTTPMethod() in v2
  ./service.go:37:14: stream.Spec() moves to the connect.NewClientContext(ctx) info's Spec field in v2
  ./service.go:37:39: stream.Peer() moves to the connect.NewClientContext(ctx) info's PeerAddr and Protocol fields in v2

